# Always deploy WebComet

When you finish code changes for WebComet:

1. Commit (unless the user forbade commits for that change).
2. Push to `origin/main`.
3. Deploy immediately via SSH:
   `ssh -i ~/.ssh/id_ed25519 root@92.242.61.24 "cd /opt/webcomet && bash scripts/deploy-vps.sh"`
4. Do not wait for the user to ask «задеплой».

Prod: https://webcomet.ru · VPS path `/opt/webcomet`.
